ame source — Browser-delivered files are not automatically the complete maintainable project; verify creator-provided source separately.","service","demo",[82],{"_63":83,"_31":84,"_85":86},"Browse games on CrazyGames","https://www.crazygames.com/","note","Browser-game portal. Individual titles have their own input, device, and network requirements.","tutorial",[89],{"_63":90,"_31":91,"_85":92},"CrazyGames publishing documentation","https://docs.crazygames.com/","Official requirements, SDK guides, testing tools, and launch workflow for web games.","Source reviewed","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[103,104],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[108],"stages","Build & release","Topics",[112,113,114],"tags","Publishing","Game discovery","Browser games","Further reading",[117,118,119],{"_63":83,"_31":84},{"_63":90,"_31":91},{"_63":120,"_31":121},"CrazyGames submission requirements","https://docs.crazygames.com/requirements/intro/","Project source",[124],{"_63":122,"_31":68},"Why it belongs here","CrazyGames hosts browser games, with a separate developer portal and documentation for submission, technical requirements, SDK integration, and testing. Submissions receive QA review; Basic Launch and Full Launch have different requirements and availability. Supported web technologies span multiple engines. A playable portal build is a distribution artifact, not evidence that the complete game project is public or that AI developed it.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Community","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[152,153,154],{"_87":147,"_80":148,"_38":149},[112,113,114],[146],[144,145],"2d","3d","ship",{"_63":90,"_31":91,"_23":87,"_85":92},{"_63":83,"_31":84,"_23":79,"_85":86},{"_63":150,"_23":75,"_85":151},"Platform listing is not game source","Browser-delivered files are not automatically the complete maintainable project; verify creator-provided source separately.",{"_63":83,"_31":84},{"_63":90,"_31":91},{"_63":120,"_31":121},"resource:gog","gog","GOG","Discover DRM-free desktop releases and submit a game to GOG's curated catalog.","/resources/gog/",{"_25":156,"_136":157,"_133":137,"_59":138,"_135":158,"_127":206,"_31":194,"_60":207,"_76":208,"_111":209,"_107":210,"_102":211,"_95":94},[162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180],{"_59":27,"_72":157,"_61":136,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":158,"_61":135,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":131,"_72":132,"_61":133,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":129,"_72":130,"_61":59,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":125,"_72":206,"_61":127,"_77":128},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":204,"_61":31,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":115,"_65":200,"_61":60,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":109,"_99":100,"_65":198,"_61":111,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":105,"_99":100,"_65":197,"_61":107,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":98,"_99":100,"_65":196,"_61":102,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":93,"_72":94,"_61":95,"_77":96},{"_59":60,"_63":87,"_65":191,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":79,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":80,"_65":186,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":79,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":38,"_72":185,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":75,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_61":70,"_63":71,"_72":184},{"_59":60,"_61":62,"_63":64,"_65":181},[182],{"_63":157,"_31":183},"https://www.gog.com/pressroom/press-kit/","Original dark GOG logo provided in the official GOG press kit. Original pixels, colors, transparency, and aspect ratio are retained. It represents the distribution platform; DRM-free availability does not imply public game source.","Platform listing is not game source — DRM-free describes distribution restrictions, not whether complete source or reusable assets are available.",[187],{"_63":188,"_31":189,"_85":190},"Browse games on GOG","https://www.gog.com/en/games","Desktop game catalog. Check the individual product and system requirements rather than assuming browser play.",[192],{"_63":193,"_31":194,"_85":195},"Submit a game to GOG","https://www.gog.com/submit-your-game","Official submission page with an embedded developer form. Catalog inclusion requires a separate publishing decision.",[103,104],[108],[112,113,199],"Desktop games",[201,202],{"_63":188,"_31":189},{"_63":193,"_31":203},"https://lp.gog.com/submit-your-game/en",[205],{"_63":122,"_31":194},"GOG is a curated digital game store with DRM-free releases and an optional desktop client. The official submission form is the developer entry point for proposing a game; submitting it does not guarantee acceptance or immediate publication. Verify each game's supported operating systems, edition, and release status. DRM-free distribution is different from publishing the game's source code.",[216,217],{"_87":212,"_80":213,"_38":214},[112,113,199],[146],[144,145],{"_63":193,"_31":194,"_23":79,"_85":195},{"_63":188,"_31":189,"_23":79,"_85":190},{"_63":150,"_23":75,"_85":215},"DRM-free describes distribution restrictions, not whether complete source or reusable assets are available.",{"_63":188,"_31":189},{"_63":193,"_31":203},"resource:epic-games-store","epic-games-store","Epic Games Store","Browse game releases and prepare store distribution through Epic's self-service developer tools.","/resources/epic-games-store/",{"_25":219,"_136":220,"_133":137,"_59":138,"_135":221,"_127":269,"_31":247,"_60":270,"_76":271,"_111":272,"_107":273,"_102":274,"_95":94},[225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243],{"_59":27,"_72":220,"_61":136,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":221,"_61":135,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":131,"_72":132,"_61":133,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":129,"_72":130,"_61":59,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":125,"_72":269,"_61":127,"_77":128},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":267,"_61":31,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":115,"_65":262,"_61":60,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":109,"_99":100,"_65":261,"_61":111,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":105,"_99":100,"_65":260,"_61":107,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":98,"_99":100,"_65":259,"_61":102,