,"_31":247,"_23":87,"_85":258},{"_63":252,"_31":253,"_23":79,"_85":254},{"_63":150,"_23":75,"_85":278},"Game source and reuse rights must be checked independently of Epic Games Store availability.",{"_63":252,"_31":253},{"_63":265,"_31":266},"resource:itch-io","itch-io","itch.io","Discover independent games and publish project pages with browser builds or downloadable releases.","/resources/itch-io/",{"_25":282,"_136":283,"_133":137,"_59":138,"_135":284,"_127":331,"_31":330,"_60":332,"_76":333,"_111":334,"_107":335,"_102":336,"_95":94},[288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306],{"_59":27,"_72":283,"_61":136,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":284,"_61":135,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":131,"_72":132,"_61":133,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":129,"_72":130,"_61":59,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":125,"_72":331,"_61":127,"_77":128},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":328,"_61":31,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":115,"_65":325,"_61":60,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":109,"_99":100,"_65":324,"_61":111,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":105,"_99":100,"_65":323,"_61":107,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_63":98,"_99":100,"_65":322,"_61":102,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":93,"_72":94,"_61":95,"_77":96},{"_59":60,"_63":87,"_65":317,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":87,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":80,"_65":312,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":79,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":38,"_72":311,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":75,"_61":76,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_61":70,"_63":71,"_72":310},{"_59":60,"_61":62,"_63":64,"_65":307},[308],{"_63":283,"_31":309},"https://itch.io/press-kit","Official itch.io app icon from the publisher’s press kit. The artwork is unchanged and bundled locally, following the request not to hotlink brand images. This mark identifies the platform rather than the creators of games hosted there.","Platform listing is not game source — Creators may publish source separately, but a game page or downloadable binary alone is not complete project source.",[313],{"_63":314,"_31":315,"_85":316},"Browse games on itch.io","https://itch.io/games","Independent game catalog with both browser and downloadable games. Availability and license vary by project.",[318],{"_63":319,"_31":320,"_85":321},"Create your first itch.io page","https://itch.io/docs/creators/getting-started","Official guide to project information, uploads, classification, publishing, and updates.",[103,104],[108],[112,113,114,199],[326,327],{"_63":314,"_31":315},{"_63":319,"_31":320},[329],{"_63":122,"_31":330},"https://itch.io/developers","itch.io lets creators manage game pages, screenshots, files, development logs, and updates. HTML5 builds can run in the browser; other releases can be provided as downloads with platform labels. A project's page can also contain a demo or work in development, so inspect the actual uploads and instructions. Publishing a playable build does not automatically make its source public.",[341,342],{"_87":337,"_80":338,"_38":339},[112,113,114,199],[146],[144,145],{"_63":319,"_31":320,"_23":87,"_85":321},{"_63":314,"_31":315,"_23":79,"_85":316},{"_63":150,"_23":75,"_85":340},"Creators may publish source separately, but a game page or downloadable binary alone is not complete project source.",{"_63":314,"_31":315},{"_63":319,"_31":320},"resource:steamworks","steamworks","Steam","Discover desktop games and use Steamworks to prepare store pages, builds, testing, and release.","/resources/steamworks/",{"_25":344,"_136":345,"_133":137,"_59":138,"_135":346,"_127":393,"_31":372,"_60":394,"_76":395,"_111":396,"_107":397,"_102":398,"_95":94},[350,351,352,353,354,355,356,357,358,359,360,361,362,363,364,365,366,367,368],{"_59":27,"_72":345,"_61":136,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":346,"_61":135,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":131,"_72":132,"_61":133,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":129,"_72":130,"_61":59,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":125,"_72":393,"_61":127,"_77":128},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":391,"_61":31,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":115,"_65":388,"_61":60,"_77":-7},{"_59":9