91":592,"_593":594},"raccoon-heist-claude",{"_581":607,"_583":608,"_585":609,"_587":610,"_589":590,"_591":592,"_593":594},"opengame-tower-defense",{"_581":603,"_583":604,"_585":605,"_587":606,"_589":590,"_591":592,"_593":594},"opengame-marvel-platformer",{"_581":599,"_583":600,"_585":601,"_587":602,"_589":590,"_591":592,"_593":594},"opengame-arithmancy-card-battle",{"_581":595,"_583":596,"_585":597,"_587":598,"_589":590,"_591":592,"_593":594},"opengame-mandalorian-shooter",{"_581":582,"_583":584,"_585":586,"_587":588,"_589":590,"_591":592,"_593":594},"src","media/learning/opengame-mandalorian-shooter.webp","alt","Mandalorian Protocol’s top-down Imperial Base level, with the player character and combat HUD.","caption","The generated top-down shooter, captured inside the Imperial Base.","sourceUrl","https://yelonhu.github.io/OpenGame-landing-page/games/starWars/index.html","capturedAt","2026-10-18","width",1280,"height",720,"media/learning/opengame-arithmancy-card-battle.webp","Arithmancy Academy’s playable spell-card duel with card choices, health bars, and the turn counter.","A real card duel: spell choices, turns, and connected battle state.","https://yelonhu.github.io/OpenGame-landing-page/games/harryPotter/index.html","media/learning/opengame-marvel-platformer.webp","Infinity Strike gameplay with a selectable hero in a pixel-art city combat stage.","From the hero-selection prompt to a playable city action stage.","https://yelonhu.github.io/OpenGame-landing-page/games/marvel/index.html","media/learning/opengame-tower-defense.webp","Hajimi Defense gameplay with a cat base, tower placement spaces, and incoming enemy waves.","The generated tower-defense game, with its build grid and live waves.","https://yelonhu.github.io/OpenGame-landing-page/games/hajimi/index.html","media/learning/raccoon-heist-claude.webp","Raccoon Heist gameplay with a 3D backyard, the player raccoon, collectible loot, and a countdown HUD.","A night in the backyard: loot, patrols, and a race back to the dumpster.","https://simonw.github.io/raccoon-heist/","media/learning/tower-of-time-ai-build.webp","Tower of Time gameplay, showing a pixel-art space station, the player ship, an enemy, and base health.","The playable battlefield behind the author’s rewind-mechanic prompts.","https://m4v3k.itch.io/tower-of-time","media/learning/claude-agent-team-tetris.webp","Tetris in play, showing colored blocks, the next piece, score, and keyboard controls.","The agent team’s finished game, with real-time board and score.","https://caiguanhao.github.io/tetris/","media/learning/tron-exonix-claude.webp","The neon TRON: EXONIX game board with a player vehicle, moving enemies, and territory boundaries.","The live Godot build: neon territory capture and moving enemies.","https://www.top3d.ai/demo/exonix-build/index.html","media/learning/moonlight-mayhem-codex.webp","A playable raccoon character in a 3D museum, with crew rescue objectives and security patrols.","Inside the museum: crew rescue, security, and the Golden Sardine.","https://simonw.github.io/raccoon-heist-codex/","media/learning/polar-icecapade-claude.webp","Polar Icecapade’s first icy 3D arena after melee propulsion and a shot, showing the moving character, gates, coins, timer and 11 of 12 ammunition.","The live first level after melee movement and a shot; ammo has fallen to 11/12.","https://evankurtzart.itch.io/polar-icecapade","origin","browser-capture","media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp","The creator’s Katana Kitsune combat screenshot with an isometric courtyard, the party, enemies, health bars and minimap.","Creator-published combat screenshot from the silent Godot prototype.","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/blob/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","originalImageUrl","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","creator-screenshot","reviewedAt","media/learning/minimal-rogue-claude.webp","Minimal Rogue first-floor gameplay with the player, breakable blocks, corridor, HP and stamina HUD, and block-cracking log.","The live first-floor room after normal movement and block-cracking inputs.","https://hirotaka-adachi.itch.io/minimal-rogue","media/learning/overexposed-ai.webp","Overexposed’s desktop card table with newspapers, career cards, money, fame, craft, heat and an End Turn control.","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io game page.","https://eg30.itch.io/overexposed","https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTA3MzQwMi8zMTAxNTIwOS5wbmc=/original/pgaZBa.png","media/learning/word-rain-chatgpt.webp","Word Rain in play, with falling letter tiles, a basket, target word, score, hearts, shield and speed indicators.","The running author-hosted game after start and ordinary direction-key basket movement.","https://octopuskid.github.io/word-rain/","media/learning/garden-match-agents.webp","A Garden Match fruit puzzle with a remaining-moves counter, apple objective, companion puppy, and settings button.","The local Garden Match project, using its documented development Canvas renderer.","https://github.com/kevinchenkai/GameAI/tree/main/garden","local-capture","2026-10-18T10:43:38.714Z","media/learning/dunkirk-ai-assisted.webp","A green player plane fires toward enemy aircraft above blue water and islands, with the score displayed.","The live Godot shooter after starting, moving, and firing at incoming aircraft.","https://cheery-sable-f2dce2.netlify.app/dunkirk.html","media/learning/gothicvania-codex.webp","GothicVania player jumps between platforms in a gothic interior with four health hearts.","Browser capture after entering the level, moving right, jumping, and attacking.","https://acatovic.github.io/gothicvania-codex-demo/","media/learning/pixel-princess-claude.webp","Pixel Princess heroine in the first forest level with apple pickups, an enemy, and the lives HUD.","Creator gameplay screenshot by Vito D’Elia, published in the project repository.",