 ball, trees and mushrooms on hilly terrain, speed and target-distance HUD.","GameMap browser capture after Play and an ordinary mouse charge/release action.","https://ahammer.github.io/vibe_golf/","media/learning/core-business-claude.webp","The Core Business mining vehicle in a three-dimensional side-view Mars scene, with fuel, hull, cargo, money and depth indicators.","The running author-hosted mining tech demo, captured with the Metal rendering backend.","https://leichtbier.github.io/core-business/","media/learning/eight-second-crew-codex.webp","A duck thief and its recorded clone in the opening museum, with key, guard sight cone and eight-second HUD.","The author-hosted game after recording the first clone.","https://sdj3261.github.io/openai_game_2026/",{"_21":1070,"_23":1002,"_25":1071,"_27":1072,"_29":1073,"_31":1074,"_33":1007,"_5":1075,"_36":1076,"_38":1010},{"_21":1057,"_23":1002,"_25":1058,"_27":1059,"_29":1060,"_31":1061,"_33":1007,"_5":1062,"_36":1063,"_38":1010},{"_21":1044,"_23":1002,"_25":1045,"_27":1046,"_29":1047,"_31":1048,"_33":1007,"_5":1049,"_36":1050,"_38":1010},{"_21":1031,"_23":1002,"_25":1032,"_27":1033,"_29":1034,"_31":1035,"_33":1007,"_5":1036,"_36":1037,"_38":1010},{"_21":1018,"_23":1002,"_25":1019,"_27":1020,"_29":1021,"_31":1022,"_33":1007,"_5":1023,"_36":1024,"_38":1010},{"_21":1001,"_23":1002,"_25":1003,"_27":1004,"_29":1005,"_31":1006,"_33":1007,"_5":1008,"_36":1009,"_38":1010},"collection:claude-community-use-cases","collection","claude-community-use-cases","Claude community use cases","Discover creator demos and build accounts. This collection also includes films, tools, and experiments beyond games.","/examples/#collection-claude-community-use-cases","/examples/",{"_25":1003,"_27":1004,"_31":1017,"_29":1005},[1011,1012,1013],"website/src/data/communityResearch.ts",{"_59":27,"_72":1004,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":1005,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1014,"_65":1015,"_61":31,"_77":-7},"Browse collection",[1016],{"_63":101