1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":1144,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":1138,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":1130,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":1123,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":1109,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},"Related resources",[1111,1112,1113,1114],"resourceIds",{"_63":1121,"_31":1122},{"_63":1119,"_31":1120},{"_63":1117,"_31":1118},{"_63":1115,"_31":1116},"Blender","/resources/blender/","Godot MCP · Coding-Solo","/resources/godot-mcp/","Godot Demo Projects","/resources/godot-demo-projects/","Godot Engine · Official Documentation","/resources/godot-engine/",[1124],{"_63":1125,"_31":1126,"_85":1127},"Open the complete 3D game source","https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/squash_the_creeps","Complete GDScript project with scenes, character assets, score, and retry behavior. Match the project branch to your Godot version.","playable","Play or run",[1131],{"_63":1132,"_31":1133,"_85":1134},"Play Squash the Creeps","https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/3d/squash_the_creeps/","Official browser build with a moving character and enemy interactions. A WebGL-capable browser and keyboard are required.","Game platform","Browser","Build story / tutorial",[1139],{"_63":1140,"_31":1141,"_85":-7},"Follow the official 3D tutorial","https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.html","Study this workflow",true,[1146,1147,1148,1149],"steps","Play the browser demo and test movement, jumping, enemy contact, and retry.","Follow the official 3D game tutorial and compare its scenes with the completed project.","Ask an agent to adjust one mechanic, such as jump height or enemy spawning.","Replace one asset at a time and check collision shapes, scale, animation, and performance.","AI workflow / foundation context","Use the working project as an agent-readable reference for movement, collisions, animation, and score. Add generated assets only after the original game loop works.","aiUse","Creation category","Human-authored engine foundation — not an AI-created game","provenance","Track","track","Engine","Godot · 3D","engine",[1146,1147,1148,1149],{"_63":1140,"_31":1141},{"_63":1132,"_31":1133,"_23":1128,"_85":1134},{"_63":1125,"_31":1126,"_85":1127},[1166,1167,1168,1169],"godot-engine","godot-demo-projects","godot-mcp","blender","foundation:phaser-starshake","phaser-starshake","Take a browser shooter to mobile","Play Starshake, a complete space shooter, then follow the official tutorial to adapt its controls and layout for mobile. This path extends an existing game.","/examples/phaser-starshake/",{"_25":1171,"_133":1087,"_1157":144,"_27":1172,"_29":1173,"_1160":1223,"_1152":1222,"_1145":1224,"_87":1225,"_80":1226,"_38":1227,"_1110":1228},[1177,1178,1179,1180,1181,1182,1183,1184,1185,1186,1187,1188,1189],{"_59":27,"_72":1172,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":1173,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":1223,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1154,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":1222,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":1217,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":1213,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":1208,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":1203,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":1190,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},[1191,1192,1193,1194],{"_63":1201,"_31":1202},{"_63":1199,"_31":1200},{"_63":1197,"_31":1198},{"_63":1195,"_31":1196},"Playwright MCP","/resources/playwright-mcp/","Codex · Create Browser-based Games","/resources/codex-browser-games/","Phaser · Examples","/resources/phaser-examples/","Phaser · First Game Guide","/resources/phaser/",[1204],{"_63":1205,"_31":1206,"_85":1207},"Open the complete Starshake project","https://github.com/phaserjs/phaser-by-example/tree/main/starshake","Complete original game with scenes, assets, and build setup. The link guide also includes the tutorial’s full mobile adaptation.",[1209],{"_63":1210,"_31":1211,"_85":1212},"Play Starshake in the Sandbox","https://phaser.io/sandbox/y1pmMkDL","In the Sandbox runtime menu, select 3.90.0. Click the game, press Space to start or shoot, and use the arrow keys to move.",[1214],{"_63":1215,"_31":1216,"_85":-7},"Follow the browser-to-mobile tutorial","https://phaser.io/tutorials/bring-your-phaser-game-to-ios-and-android-with-capacitor",[1218,1219,1220,1221],"In the official Sandbox, choose Phaser 3.90.0, then play with the arrow keys and Space.","Explore the complete original game and the tutorial’s separate mobile project.","Follow the official Capacitor tutorial for touch input, resizing, and mobile packaging.","Use an agent to make one change, then verify the game on desktop and mobile.","Ask an agent to explain the game scenes, then help adapt input, tune enemy waves, or add touch controls. Check each change against the working browser reference.","Phaser · Browser / mobile",[1218,1219,1220,1221],{"_63":1215,"_31":1216},{"_63":1210,"_31":1211,"_23":1128,"_85":1212},{"_63":1205,"_31":1206,"_85":1207},[1229,1230,1231,1232],"phaser","phaser-examples","codex-browser-games","playwright-mcp","foundation:godot-2d-dodge","godot-2d-dodge","Your first 2D game","Dodge enemies, survive longer, and restart a complete small game. This official Godot project is a foundation for an AI-assisted workflow.","/examples/godot-2d-dodge/",{"_25":1234,"_133":1087,"_1157":144,"_27":1235,"_29":1236,"_1160":1282,"_1152":1281,"_1145":1283,"_87":1284,"_80":1285,"_38":1286,"_1110":1287},[1240,1241,1242,1243,1244,1245,1246,1247,1248,1249,1250,1251,1252],{"_59":27,"_72":1235,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":1236,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":1282,"_61":1160,"_77":1