,"_31":1558,"_85":1666},"Primary author disclosure applies to the collection. It does not publish per-game prompts or identify the final version’s exact model.",[1668],{"_63":1669,"_31":1670,"_85":1671},"Open the complete single-file game","https://github.com/JoeySalmons/vibe-coded-games/blob/main/Pirate%20Fleet%20Commander%20v7.4.html","Complete game code, styles, interface, and Canvas graphics are contained in this HTML file.",[1673],{"_63":1674,"_31":729,"_85":1675},"Play Pirate Fleet Commander","Use WASD or the arrow keys to sail and the on-screen controls for fleet management. Desktop recommended.",[1677],{"_63":1571,"_31":1558,"_85":-7},[1679,1680,1681,1682],"Play the fleet game and test sailing, combat, repairs, and upgrades.","Read the author’s collection-wide AI disclosure.","Inspect the individual HTML file’s game loop and fleet economy.","Download that file and change one ship statistic before replaying.","Joey Salmons says the collection began with Gemini 2.5 Pro in AI Studio and Claude Sonnet 4.5, with manual edits limited to small balance changes. The exact model used for this version is not specified.",[1679,1680,1681,1682],{"_63":1571,"_31":1558,"_23":1442},{"_63":1674,"_31":729,"_23":1128,"_85":1675},{"_63":1669,"_31":1670,"_85":1671,"_1463":1464},{"_63":1557,"_31":1558,"_85":1666},[],"example:beach-kitty-ai-campaign","Beach Kitty","A cat-led Phaser campaign that combines running, platforming, shooting, and other arcade mechanics, with optional generated cat art.","/examples/beach-kitty-ai-campaign/",{"_25":515,"_27":1691,"_29":1692,"_1160":1747,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":1746,"_1145":1748,"_87":1749,"_80":1750,"_38":1751,"_1424":1752,"_1110":1753},[1696,1697,1698,1699,1700,1701,1702,1703,1704,1705,1706,1707,1708,1709,1710,1711,1712,1713,1714],{"_59":27,"_72":1691,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":1692,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":1747,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1