 agent, then compare a complete customer-service loop.","The author names Cursor with Gemini 2.5 Pro, Claude Opus 4 and Claude Sonnet 4, and links a creation video. The fully AI-generated description is a creator claim; the public source separates the Unity project and Hunyuan model work.","Unity 2023.2.6f1 · URP · C#",[4422,4423,4424,4425],{"_63":4420,"_31":835,"_23":1442},{"_63":4415,"_31":4416,"_23":1434,"_85":4417},{"_63":1980,"_31":4411,"_85":4412,"_1463":1464},{"_63":4407,"_31":835,"_85":4408},[4434],"unity-engine","example:magic-carpet-wizard-astra","Magic Carpet Wizard · A Thousand Skies","Fly a carpet over a tiny spherical world, thread scoring rings, cast three spells and face roaming enemies and bosses. Local ghost races let two players take turns.","/examples/magic-carpet-wizard-astra/",{"_25":471,"_27":4436,"_29":4437,"_1160":1578,"_1157":145,"_133":1454,"_1152":4485,"_1145":4486,"_87":4487,"_80":4488,"_38":4489,"_1424":4490,"_1110":4491},[4441,4442,4443,4444,4445,4446,4447,4448,4449,4450,4451,4452,4453,4454,4455,4456,4457,4458,4459],{"_59":27,"_72":4436,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4437,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":1578,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4485,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4480,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4477,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1442,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4473,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4469,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4464,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":4462,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4461},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":839,"_581":4460,"_583":838,"_38":840,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1491},{"_59":69,"_61":1404,"_63":1405,"_72":841},"/GameMap/media/learning/magic-carpet-wizard-astra.webp",[2296],[4463],{"_63":1418,"_31":1419},[4465],{"_63":4466,"_31":4467,"_85":4468},"See the creator’s Astra attribution","https://github.com/threapchills/MagicCarpetWizard","The author-controlled repository description names GPT-6 Astra. It does not establish which coding-agent client was used or publish the initial session.",[4470],{"_63":4471,"_31":4467,"_85":4472},"Open the complete carpet-flight project","Flight, enemies, spells, procedural world, audio, races and tests. Node.js 22; npm ci then npm run dev. No API keys; optional Google Fonts fall back to system fonts.",[4474],{"_63":4475,"_31":840,"_85":4476},"Play Magic Carpet Wizard","Desktop WebGL2, mouse and keyboard. Enter starts; WASD steers/climbs, mouse plus left click aims/casts, 1–3 changes spells, Space rolls, Shift boosts, and R retries.",[4478],{"_63":4479,"_31":4467,"_85":-7},"Read the creator’s implementation guide",[4481,4482,4483,4484],"Play an adventure run and test flight and spells.","Read the creator’s attribution and audio notes.","Inspect flight rules, collision and rendering modules.","Adjust one obstacle or spell and test a retry and ghost race.","The creator’s repository About section attributes the game to GPT-6 Astra. The README documents original procedural geometry and textures plus supplied audio; it does not publish prompts, a transcript or an exact division of human and model work.",[4481,4482,4483,4484],{"_63":4479,"_31":4467,"_23":1442},{"_63":4475,"_31":840,"_23":1128,"_85":4476},{"_63":4471,"_31":4467,"_1463":1464,"_85":4472},{"_63":4466,"_31":4467,"_85":4468},[1462],"example:sakura-crossing-qwen","3D Sakura Crossing: an exploration prototype","Explore a cel-shaded Japanese neighbourhood with a working railway crossing, residents, a lifting bridge, a drivable car, and a swimmable river.","/examples/sakura-crossing-qwen/",{"_25":469,"_27":4493,"_29":4494