s unsupported. The original author has ended active development. The creator describes an exploration prototype, not a finished campaign; no complete win/loss loop is claimed.",[4533],{"_63":4534,"_31":4535,"_85":4536},"Explore Sakura Crossing","https://danymaniglie-cmyk.github.io/3d-sakura-crossing/","Exploration prototype. WASD walks, Shift runs, mouse drag looks, E talks, F enters/exits the car, and Space/C swims up/down. Touch controls included; mobile performance remains limited.",[4538],{"_63":4539,"_31":4540,"_85":-7},"Read the rendering and implementation recipe","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing/blob/main/CARTOON.md",[4542,4543,4544,4545],"Explore the browser world on foot, then try the car, river, and moving bridge.","Read the credits and the author’s account of using a local Qwen model through Claude Code CLI.","Inspect CARTOON.md and the complete index.html plus vendored Three.js dependency.","Serve a local copy over HTTP, change one interaction, and verify movement and collisions.","The repository credits code generation to locally running Qwen 3.8 27B, followed by human review, debugging, and extensions. In the linked build account the author identifies Claude Code CLI as the harness with Qwen as its model.",[4542,4543,4544,4545],{"_63":4539,"_31":4540,"_23":1755},{"_63":4534,"_31":4535,"_23":1128,"_85":4536},{"_63":2784,"_31":845,"_1463":1464,"_85":4531},{"_63":4526,"_31":4527,"_85":4528},[1462],"example:claude-dreaming-godot","Claude Dreaming","Walk from a pixel-art attic into playable 3D paintings: a dream garden, space flight, small planets, and community-built rooms.","/examples/claude-dreaming-godot/",{"_25":467,"_27":4554,"_29":4555,"_1160":3933,"_1157":145,"_133":1454,"_1152":4606,"_1145":4607,"_87":4608,"_80":4609,"_38":4610,"_1424":4611,"_1110":4612},[4559,4560,4561,4562,4563,4564,4565,4566,4567,4568,4569,4570,4571,4572,4573,4574,4575,4576,4577,4578],{"_59":27,"_72":4554,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4555,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":3933,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4606,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4601,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4597,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":87,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":283,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4593,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4589,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4585,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":4583,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4582},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":849,"_581":4581,"_583":848,"_38":850,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":4579},[4580],{"_63":1893,"_31":851},"/GameMap/media/learning/claude-dreaming-godot.webp",[1552],[4584],{"_63":1121,"_31":1122},[4586],{"_63":4587,"_31":850,"_85":4588},"Read the creator’s AI contribution disclosure","The creator explicitly credits Claude and discloses assisted code, graphics, sounds, and text. This is an author disclosure and contribution workflow, not a complete development transcript.",[4590],{"_63":2108,"_31":4591,"_85":4592},"https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming","Full scenes, GDScript, levels, rooms, assets, film intro, and export presets. Run with Godot 4.7.2 standard: import project.godot and press F5. Code is MIT; original assets are CC BY 4.0, while film material and film-derived art have project-only restrictions in NOTICE.md.",[4594],{"_63":4595,"_31":850,"_85":4596},"Play Claude Dreaming","In-development HTML5 game. WASD moves; mouse looks, Space jumps/glides, E enters paintings, R respawns, and Esc pauses. Menus are German; Claude speaks English. The film intro can be skipped.",[4598],{"_63":4599,"_31":4600,"_85":-7},"Read how to add a dream with Claude","https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md",[4602,4603,4604,4605],"Start the browser build; hold Enter to skip the film if desired.","Enter a painting and compare its movement with the attic and community rooms.","Import the full project in Godot 4.7.2 standard, then read the level template and contribution guide.","Create one small level through the published API and test entry, movement, respawn, and returning to the attic.","Rusty credits the game to Rusty and Claude and discloses AI assistance for code, graphics, sounds, and text. The repository provides contribution instructions and a level API for building further dreams with Claude.",[4602,4603,4604,4605],{"_63":4599,"_31":4600,"_23":87},{"_63":4595,"_31":850,"_23":1128,"_85":4596},{"_63":2108,"_31":4591,"_1463":1464,"_85":4592},{"_63":4587,"_31":850,"_85":4588},[1166],"example:sprout-quest-claude","Sprout Quest","Explore a small world, fight real-time arena battles, gather materials, craft gear and rebuild a village. Sprout Quest is a mobile-first adventure with a 2D world and live-rendered 3D characters and items.","/examples/sprout-quest-claude/",{"_25":465,"_27":4614,"_29":4615,"_1160":4670,"_3377":4671,"_1157":144,"_133":2260,"_1152":4668,"_1145":4672,"_87":4673,"_80":4674,"_38":4675,"_1424":4676,"_1110":4677},[4619,4620,4621,4622,4623,4624,4625,4626,4627,4628,4629,4630,4631,4632,4633,4634,4635,4636,4637,4638,4639],{"_59":27,"_72":4614,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4615,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4670,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":3375,"_99":100,"_65":4669,"_61":3377,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":2259,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4668,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4663,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4661,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1736,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4656,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4652,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4648,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":4644,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4643},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":854,"_581":4642,"_583":853,"_38":855,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":4640},[4641],{"_63":1893,"_31":856},"/GameMap/media/learning/sprout-quest-claude.webp",[1717],[4645,4646,4647],{"_63":1717,"_31":1721},{"_63":1418,"_31":1419},{"_63":1115,"_31":1116},[4649],{"_63":4407,"_31":4650,"_85":4651},"https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest#how-it-was-built","README separates the original build from later human playtest/AI iteration; publishes source modules, generated models and runtime assets, plus a prompt summary. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[4653],{"_63":1980,"_31":4654,"_85":4655},"https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest","Complete game code, runtime GLBs/sprite atlases, Blender scripts and tests. bun install then bun run dev opens localhost:3000; normal builds use committed art and do not require Blender. No root LICENSE was found, so public source visibility does not establish broad reuse permission.",[4657],{"_63":4658,"_31":4659,"_85":4660},"Play Sprout Quest","https://aibengineering.github.io/sprout-quest/","Author-hosted browser adventure designed for portrait phones, with desktop keyboard controls and localStorage saves.",[4662],{"_63":2667,"_31":4650,"_85":-7},[4664,4665,4666,4667],"Play the portrait-browser prologue and follow its first fight, gathering and forge tasks.","Read the build account to see how human phone playtests guided later Claude Code changes.","Run bun install and bun run dev; inspect the game modules, committed runtime assets and Blender builders.","Change one combat, crafting or story rule with an agent, then replay the affected progression and save flow.","The creator says Claude Code generated the game, tests and Blender art pipeline from plain-language requests while the human played on a phone and gave feedback. The repository contains the runtime art as well as its source builders.",[1115],"Custom Canvas 2D + Three.js · TypeScript",[1115],[4664,4665,4666,4667],{"_63":2667,"_31":4650,"_23":1755},{"_63":4658,"_31":4659,"_23":1128,"_85":4660},{"_63":1980,"_31":4654,"_85":4655,"_1463":1464},{"_63":4407,"_31":4650,"_85":4651},[1754,1462,1169],"example:mosswing-astra","Mosswing","Keep a small creature airborne with one-tap flaps, pass scrolling stone gaps and chase a higher score in a compact 3D browser game.","/examples/mosswing-astra/",{"_25":463,"_27":4679,"_29":4680,"_1160":4727,"_1157":145,"_133":2260,"_1152":4726,"_1145":4728,"_87":4729,"_80":4730,"_38":4731,"_1424":4732,"_1110":4733},[4684,4685,4686,4687,4688,4689,4690,4691,4692,4693,4694,4695,4696,4697,4698,4699,4700,4701],{"_59":27,"_72":4679,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4680,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4727,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":2259,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4726,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4721,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4718,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":2728,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4714,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4709,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4704,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4703},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":859,"_581":4702,"_583":858,"_38":860,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1491},{"_59":69,"_61":1404,"_63":1405,"_72":861},"/GameMap/media/learning/mosswing-astra.webp",[2296],[4705],{"_63":4706,"_31":4707,"_85":4708},"Read the creator’s test and prompt","https://github.com/Ayi1337/gpt6-astra-one-shot-games#02--mosswing","The author labels this an Astra one-shot test and preserves the initial instructions and generated artifact. The coding-agent client is not identified.",[4710],{"_63":4711,"_31":4712,"_85":4713},"Open the complete Mosswing source","https://github.com/Ayi1337/gpt6-astra-one-shot-games/tree/main/mosswing","Contains the complete standalone HTML and separate source files. No package installation or build step is required. A public source license was not observed.",[4715],{"_63":4716,"_31":860,"_85":4717},"Play Mosswing","Designed for a mobile browser with one-tap control. The repository also supplies a standalone mosswing.html that can be opened in a modern browser without installation.",[4719],{"_63":4720,"_31":4707,"_85":-7},"Read the original one-shot prompt",[4722,4723,4724,4725],"Play and identify gravity, flap impulse and scoring.","Read the original prompt alongside the single HTML result.","Inspect the separate source folder before editing.","Change one flight parameter and compare collision and restart behavior.","Ayi1337 publishes the original Astra prompt and resulting standalone HTML, reporting a one-shot Xhigh test. The human specified tap-to-flap rules and requested an original character, world and visual style; this is a creator claim, not an audited generation trace.","Three.js · JavaScript · WebGL",[4722,4723,4724,4725],{"_63":4720,"_31":4707,"_23":2728},{"_63":4716,"_31":860,"_23":1128,"_85":4717},{"_63":4711,"_31":4712,"_1463":1464,"_85":4713},{"_63":4706,"_31":4707,"_85":4708},[],"example:astra-floor-ai","Astra Floor","Fight six zombie waves and a final boss in a first-person industrial arena, managing ammunition, recoil, stamina and purchases between rounds.","/examples/astra-floor-ai/",{"_25":461,"_27":4735,"_29":4736,"_1160":4789,"_1157":145,"_133":1454,"_1152":4788,"_1145":4790,"_87":4791,"_80":4792,"_38":4793,"_1424":4794,"_1110":4795},[4740,4741,4742,4743,4744,4745,4746,4747,4748,4749,4750,4751,4752,4753,4754,4755,4756,4757,4758,4759],{"_59":27,"_72":4735,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4736,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4789,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4788,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4783,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4780,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1442,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4775,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4770,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4766,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":4764,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4763},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":864,"_581":4762,"_583":863,"_38":865,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":4760},[4761],{"_63":1893,"_31":866},"/GameMap/media/learning/astra-floor-ai.webp",[2097,3223],[4765],{"_63":1418,"_31":1419},[4767],{"_63":4768,"_31":865,"_85":4769},"Read the author’s division of AI work","The repository owner’s submission distinguishes Astra from Antigravity work. The README also credits both tools; no full conversation archive is supplied.",[4771],{"_63":4772,"_31":4773,"_85":4774},"Open the complete FPS project","https://github.com/BEROCHLU/astrafloor","Game implementation, procedural models, bundled textures/music and tests. Node.js 22.13+; npm install then npm run dev. Third-party texture credits are documented separately.",[4776],{"_63":4777,"_31":4778,"_85":4779},"Play Astra Floor","https://astrafloor.berochlu.workers.dev/","Desktop WebGL, keyboard and mouse. Wait for INITIALIZING to finish, choose a difficulty, then DEPLOY. WASD moves, mouse aims/fires, R reloads, Q heals, G throws a grenade, and V uses melee. Runs are not saved. The in-app browser could not capture the mouse during review; a normal desktop browser is recommended.",[4781],{"_63":4782,"_31":865,"_85":-7},"Read the creator’s AI development disclosure",[4784,4785,4786,4787],"Choose Normal difficulty and enter the first wave.","Read the creator’s architecture and model disclosure.","Inspect procedural weapons, enemies and audio implementation.","Tune one weapon or enemy and verify a wave and shop transition.","BEROCHLU credits GPT-6 Astra with much of the architecture, procedural 3D generation and Web Audio synthesis. Antigravity 2.0 supplied other implementation and iterative refinement. The disclosure does not claim a single-prompt build.","Three.js · TypeScript (React UI)",[4784,4785,4786,4787],{"_63":4782,"_31":865,"_23":1442},{"_63":4777,"_31":4778,"_23":1128,"_85":4779},{"_63":4772,"_31":4773,"_1463":1464,"_85":4774},{"_63":4768,"_31":865,"_85":4769},[1462],"example:isocoaster-cursor","IsoCoaster","Lay out a theme park with roller coasters, rides and guests. IsoCoaster is a separate playable game and route in the creator’s Cursor-assisted IsoCity repository.","/examples/isocoaster-cursor/",{"_25":459,"_27":4797,"_29":4798,"_1160":4845,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":4844,"_1145":4846,"_87":4847,"_80":4848,"_38":4849,"_1424":4850,"_1110":4851},[4802,4803,4804,4805,4806,4807,4808,4809,4810,4811,4812,4813,4814,4815,4816,4817,4818,4819,4820],{"_59":27,"_72":4797,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4798,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4845,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4844,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_5