nderer supports a different simulation; the source does not disclose a specific model or a full AI conversation.","Custom Canvas 2D · TypeScript",[4840,4841,4842,4843],{"_63":4420,"_31":870,"_23":1442},{"_63":4834,"_31":4835,"_23":1128,"_85":4836},{"_63":1980,"_31":4830,"_85":4831,"_1463":1464},{"_63":4407,"_31":870,"_85":4827},[],"example:spirit-of-kiro","Spirit of Kiro","Find unusual items, combine or transform them on a workshop bench, and sell the results to an AI appraiser in an open-ended crafting game.","/examples/spirit-of-kiro/",{"_25":457,"_27":4853,"_29":4854,"_1160":4906,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":4905,"_1145":4907,"_87":4908,"_80":4909,"_38":4910,"_1424":4911,"_1110":4912},[4858,4859,4860,4861,4862,4863,4864,4865,4866,4867,4868,4869,4870,4871,4872,4873,4874,4875,4876],{"_59":27,"_72":4853,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4854,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4906,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4905,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4900,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4897,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":87,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1440,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4892,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1434,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4887,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4882,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4880},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":874,"_581":4879,"_583":873,"_38":875,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":4877},[4878],{"_63":1893,"_31":876},"/GameMap/media/learning/spirit-of-kiro.webp",[4881],"Kiro",[4883],{"_63":4884,"_31":4885,"_85":4886},"Read the official Kiro development disclosure","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro#spirit-of-kiro","Official creator statement reports more than 95% prompted code. The core crafting loop is complete; roadmap features and intentionally unfinished challenge-branch tasks remain separate.",[4888],{"_63":4889,"_31":4890,"_85":4891},"Open the complete crafting-game project","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro","MIT-0 game repository with Vue client, Bun server, item-image service, infrastructure, and deployment documentation. Runtime item text and interactions depend on AWS Bedrock; item-image generation has additional optional model requirements.",[4893],{"_63":4894,"_31":4895,"_85":4896},"Download and run Spirit of Kiro","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No anonymous hosted game is linked by the official project. Local play requires Docker/Podman, an AWS account/credentials and CLI, Bedrock access to supported text models, and deployed Cognito resources. Follow docs/local-setup.md to launch the stack and bootstrap DynamoDB. AWS runtime usage can incur charges; source-checked steps, not executed.",[4898],{"_63":4899,"_31":875,"_85":-7},"Follow the official learn-by-playing guide",[4901,4902,4903,4904],"Read the official setup guide and confirm the AWS model access required for the runtime.","Deploy the Cognito resources, start the client/server stack, and bootstrap the local DynamoDB tables.","Play the discover, craft, and sell loop before attempting the challenge branch.","Follow one guided bug fix or feature change and verify the resulting interaction in the game.","The official Kiro project says more than 95% of its code was written by prompting Kiro. Its guide uses the actual game to teach steering, bug fixes, refactoring, specifications, hooks, and MCP; AI also generates items and crafting outcomes at runtime.","Custom Vue 3 · DOM/CSS sprites · TypeScript",[4901,4902,4903,4904],{"_63":4899,"_31":875,"_23":87},{"_63":4894,"_31":4895,"_23":1434,"_85":4896},{"_63":4889,"_31":4890,"_1463":1464,"_85":4891},{"_63":4884,"_31":4885,"_85":4886},[],"example:rhythm-master-windsurf","Rhythm Master 3D","A four-lane music game with generated synth tracks, difficulty settings, combos and a special mode, implemented as a single browser HTML file.","/examples/rhythm-master-windsurf/",{"_25":455,"_27":4914,"_29":4915,"_1160":4966,"_1157":145,"_1152":4965,"_1145":4967,"_87":4968,"_80":4969,"_38":4970,"_1424":4971,"_1110":4972,"_133":1454},[4919,4920,4921,4922,4923,4924,4925,4926,4927,4928,4929,4930,4931,4932,4933,4934,4935,4936,4937],{"_59":27,"_72":4914,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4915,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4966,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":4965,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":4960,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":4957,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1736,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1440,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":4952,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1434,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":4948,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":4943,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":4941,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":4939},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":879,"_581":4938,"_583":878,"_38":880,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1410},{"_59":69,"_61":1404,"_63":1405,"_72":94},"/GameMap/media/learning/rhythm-master-windsurf.webp",[4940,1552],"Windsurf",[4942],{"_63":1418,"_31":1419},[4944],{"_63":4945,"_31":4946,"_85":4947},"Read the author’s AI tools and prompt disclosure","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/frankniu_if-youre-not-vibe-coding-with-claude-sonnet-activity-7304977951761039362-2xQe","The creator identifies Claude Sonnet 3.7, describes passing output into Windsurf, and links the exact rhythm-game repository in the same post.",[4949],{"_63":4950,"_31":880,"_85":4951},"Open the complete rhythm-game source","The full game is rhythm.html, with procedural music and geometry rather than a separate asset download. Third-party libraries load from CDNs. No repository code license is declared.",[4953],{"_63":4954,"_31":4955,"_85":4956},"Download and run Rhythm Master 3D","https://github.com/frankjniu/rhythm-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No public hosted build was verified. Serve the downloaded directory and open rhythm.html. External CDNs supply Three.js and Tone.js, so internet access is needed; a click starts audio.",[4958],{"_63":4959,"_31":4946,"_85":-7},"Read the creator’s build workflow",[4961,4962,4963,4964],"Download the repository and serve its directory with a local HTTP server, then open rhythm.html.","Choose a track and difficulty, start the game, and use D/F/J/K as notes reach the target zone.","Test combo scoring, Escape pause and the Space special mode before changing timing or difficulty.","Compare the single-file implementation with the creator’s original brief and debugging workflow.","Frank Niu links this game from a creator post describing a Claude Sonnet 3.7 web-chat-to-Windsurf workflow: generate an initial game, diagnose issues in chat, then apply changes in Windsurf. It is a human-steered coding example, not evidence that Claude Code or a single autonomous run built it.","Three.js · Tone.js · JavaScript",[4961,4962,4963,4964],{"_63":4959,"_31":4946,"_23":1755},{"_63":4954,"_31":4955,"_23":1434,"_85":4956},{"_63":4950,"_31":880,"_85":4951,"_1463":1464},{"_63":4945,"_31":4946,"_85":4947},[1462],"example:pokemon-tactics-claude","Pokemon Tactics","Move Pokemon across an isometric battlefield, use elevation and aim area attacks without hitting allies. This playable tactical fan game combines a TypeScript simulation with 2D-HD sprites on Babylon.js terrain.","/examples/pokemon-tactics-claude/",{"_25":453,"_27":4974,"_29":4975,"_1160":5026,"_1157":145,"_133":1454,"_1152":5025,"_1145":5027,"_87":5028,"_80":5029,"_38":5030,"_1424":5031,"_1110":5032},[4979,4980,4981,4982,4983,4984,4985,4986,4987,4988,4989,4990,4991,4992,4993,4994,4995,4996,4997,4998],{"_59":27,"_72":4974,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":4975,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":5026,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5025,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":5020,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":5018,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1442,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":283,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":5013,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":5009,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":5005,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":5003,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":5002},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":883,"_581":5001,"_583":882,"_38":884,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":4999},[5000],{"_63":1893,"_31":885},"/GameMap/media/learning/pokemon-tactics-claude.webp",[1717],[5004],{"_63":1717,"_31":1721},[5006],{"_63":4407,"_31":5007,"_85":5008},"https://github.com/kekel87/pokemon-tactics#built-with-ai","Author explains human direction versus generated implementation; independent itch page repeats AI and art disclosure. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[5010],{"_63":1980,"_31":5011,"_85":5012},"https://github.com/kekel87/pokemon-tactics","Complete pnpm workspace with game core, Pokemon data, Babylon renderer, UI and app assets. package.json requires Node >=24 and pnpm 10.32.1; pnpm install then pnpm dev. Code MIT; many sprites/tiles use CC BY-NC 4.0 and some effect particles have no separate license. Noncommercial fan project; read CREDITS.md.",[5014],{"_63":5015,"_31":5016,"_85":5017},"Play Pokemon Tactics","https://kekel87.itch.io/pokemon-tactics","Author-hosted browser demo on itch.io; choose Run game. Includes AI opponents and hot-seat play. An in-development fan project.",[5019],{"_63":4420,"_31":5007,"_85":-7},[5021,5022,5023,5024],"Play a battle against the built-in opponents and test movement, height, type matchups and friendly fire.","Read the AI disclosure and CREDITS.md before exploring the engine and rendering packages.","Use Node 24 or later and pnpm 10.32.1 to run the complete workspace locally.","Change one tactical rule with an agent, then compare battle resolution, team setup and replay behavior.","The creator directs design and architecture while Claude Code writes most code, tests and documentation with specialist agents. Pokemon data, sprites and some PixelLab artwork have separate credits and rights.","Babylon.js · TypeScript",[5021,5022,5023,5024],{"_63":4420,"_31":5007,"_23":1442},{"_63":5015,"_31":5016,"_23":1128,"_85":5017},{"_63":1980,"_31":5011,"_85":5012,"_1463":1464},{"_63":4407,"_31":5007,"_85":5008},[1754],"example:clowder-and-crest-agents","Clowder & Crest","Recruit cats into a medieval guild, take jobs across fifteen minigame types, develop bonds and follow a seven-chapter campaign shaped by the guild’s reputation.","/examples/clowder-and-crest-agents/",{"_25":451,"_27":5034,"_29":5035,"_1160":2197,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":5096,"_1145":5097,"_87":5098,"_80":5099,"_38":5100,"_1424":5101,"_1110":5102,"_2113":5103},[5039,5040,5041,5042,5043,5044,5045,5046,5047,5048,5049,5050,5051,5052,5053,5054,5055,5056,5057,5058],{"_59":27,"_72":5034,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5035,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":2197,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5096,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99"