/releases/tag/v2.8.0","Download — Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.",[5085],{"_63":5086,"_31":889,"_85":5087},"Play Clowder & Crest","Browser campaign with mouse/touch minigames. The title screen also offers a spoiler-marked unlocked minigame archive. Android/iOS packaging is included, but native installation has separate platform requirements. Initial asset loading can be slow.",[5089],{"_63":5090,"_31":5068,"_85":-7},"Read the creator’s tool and code credits",[5092,5093,5094,5095],"Start a guild and complete an opening job.","Read the tool credits and separate coding lanes.","Inspect one minigame and its dedicated playtest.","Change one job mechanic and check campaign progression and saves.","JacobStephens2 identifies Claude Code as the primary coding and design partner, Codex CLI as a second coding lane, and Gemini CLI as a third. PixelLab, Midjourney, ElevenLabs and Suno supplied different asset types; the repository contains per-agent task files.",[5092,5093,5094,5095],{"_63":5090,"_31":5068,"_23":1442},{"_63":5086,"_31":889,"_23":1128,"_85":5087},{"_63":5072,"_31":5073,"_1463":1464,"_85":5074},{"_63":5067,"_31":5068,"_85":5069},[1229,1289,4067],[5104,5105],{"_2140":5081,"_31":5082,"_23":1434,"_85":5107},{"_2140":5078,"_31":5079,"_23":1434,"_85":5106},"Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.","example:novel-journey-to-west","Journey to the West: Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan","A Chinese turn-based RPG with painted walking maps, quests, equipment, pets and command battles, adapted from the Banana Fan chapters of Journey to the West.","/examples/novel-journey-to-west/",{"_25":449,"_27":5109,"_29":5110,"_1160":5161,"_1157":144,"_1152":5160,"_1145":5162,"_87":5163,"_80":5164,"_38":5165,"_1424":5166,"_133":1454,"_1110":5167},[5114,5115,5116,5117,5118,5119,5120,5121,5122,5123,5124,5125,5126,5127,5128,5129,5130,5131,5132],{"_59":27,"_72":5109,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5110,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":5161,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5160,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":5155,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":5152,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1736,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":5147,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":5142,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":5137,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":5136},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":893,"_581":5135,"_583":892,"_38":894,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":5133},[5134],{"_63":1893,"_31":895},"/GameMap/media/learning/novel-journey-to-west.webp",[2296],[5138],{"_63":5139,"_31":5140,"_85":5141},"Read the creator’s workflow and example record","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game#play-online","The creator links the game to the NovelToGame workflow and its adaptation workspace. Published QA is author evidence, not a GameMap reproduction.",[5143],{"_63":5144,"_31":5145,"_85":5146},"Open the complete adaptation and game","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/tree/main/examples/journey-to-the-west","Includes the static game, painted scene and character assets, design workspace and browser QA. No generation API is required to play the committed build. Repository MIT terms and the source/asset ledgers should be read together.",[5148],{"_63":5149,"_31":5150,"_85":5151},"Play Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan","https://xiyouji.vibecoco.ai/","Chinese-language browser prototype. Click to walk, interact with marked NPCs and choose battle commands. The author records a desktop completion path; narrow-screen play has separate limitations.",[5153],{"_63":5154,"_31":5145,"_85":-7},"Read the adaptation workspace",[5156,5157,5158,5159],"Play the village and use the quest tracker to reach an NPC or a battle.","Compare the novel chapter references with the selected fan, transformation and five-element mechanics.","Read the design, art and QA files to distinguish implemented systems from deliberately omitted multiplayer features.","To run locally, serve examples/journey-to-the-west/build/app with python3 -m http.server 5173; inspect the JavaScript battle implementation before changing a rule.","Zenstory publishes this as a NovelToGame agent-workflow result, with source analysis, rejected concepts, game and art direction, generated artwork, game implementation and QA records. The example does not identify one specific coding client; support for several clients is not proof that all were used.","Custom Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM UI",[5156,5157,5158,5159],{"_63":5154,"_31":5145,"_23":1755},{"_63":5149,"_31":5150,"_23":1128,"_85":5151},{"_63":5144,"_31":5145,"_85":5146,"_1463":1464},{"_63":5139,"_31":5140,"_85":5141},[],"example:vibe-racer-opencode","Vibe Racer","A top-down time-trial racer with saved best laps, player and creator ghosts, mud surfaces, and a built-in track editor.","/examples/vibe-racer-opencode/",{"_25":447,"_27":5169,"_29":5170,"_1160":5226,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":5225,"_1145":5227,"_87":5228,"_80":5229,"_38":5230,"_1424":5231,"_1110":5232},[5174,5175,5176,5177,5178,5179,5180,5181,5182,5183,5184,5185,5186,5187,5188,5189,5190,5191,5192,5193],{"_59":27,"_72":5169,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5170,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72