 handle sprite padding.","Change one unit or UI rule with an agent, then replay the battle and inspect the included test harness.","The creator combined a PRD, technical design and curated asset metadata with three Claude Code skills for Phaser gameplay, tilemaps and frontend testing. Human-made Tiny Swords assets are credited separately; this is a prototype.",[5351,5352,5353,5354],{"_63":5349,"_31":909,"_23":1755},{"_63":5344,"_31":5345,"_23":1128,"_85":5346},{"_63":1980,"_31":5340,"_85":5341,"_1463":1464},{"_63":4407,"_31":909,"_85":5337},[1754,1229],"example:silent-meridian-codex","Silent Meridian","Investigate an observatory trapped at 00:17, compare Present and Echo states, and solve thirteen connected puzzles across four chapters with a journal and optional hints.","/examples/silent-meridian-codex/",{"_25":441,"_27":5363,"_29":5364,"_1160":5418,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":5417,"_1145":5419,"_87":5420,"_80":5421,"_38":5422,"_1424":5423,"_1110":5424},[5368,5369,5370,5371,5372,5373,5374,5375,5376,5377,5378,5379,5380,5381,5382,5383,5384,5385,5386,5387],{"_59":27,"_72":5363,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5364,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":5418,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5417,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":5412,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":5409,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1736,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":5404,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":5399,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":5394,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":5392,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":5391},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":913,"_581":5390,"_583":912,"_38":914,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1899},{"_59":69,"_61":1896,"_63":1897,"_72":94},{"_59":60,"_61":1892,"_63":1893,"_65":5388},[5389],{"_63":1893,"_31":915},"/GameMap/media/learning/silent-meridian-codex.webp",[2169],[5393],{"_63":1258,"_31":1259},[5395],{"_63":5396,"_31":5397,"_85":5398},"Read the human and AI contribution record","https://github.com/stackloomdev/silent-meridian/blob/main/docs/CREATION.md","Creator-published model roles, iterative workflow and validation limits. It explicitly describes point-and-click scenes rather than a freely walkable 3D world.",[5400],{"_63":5401,"_31":5402,"_85":5403},"Open the complete puzzle-game project","https://github.com/stackloomdev/silent-meridian","Includes all puzzle logic, chapters, illustrations, local saves, audio, tests and design notes. Node.js 22; npm run dev. No backend, API key, CDN or runtime dependencies.",[5405],{"_63":5406,"_31":5407,"_85":5408},"Play Silent Meridian","https://silent-meridian.pjstack.dev/","English and Chinese; mouse, touch and keyboard. Click objects to investigate; Space changes time, J opens the journal, and Esc closes dialogs. Optional WebGL depth has an illustrated fallback.",[5410],{"_63":5411,"_31":5397,"_85":-7},"Read the creation record",[5413,5414,5415,5416],"Start the opening chapter and compare the two time states.","Read the creation record and art provenance.","Inspect puzzle rules separately from presentation code.","Modify one clue and verify uniqueness, hints and saved progress.","stackloomdev directed iterative GPT-6 Astra work in Codex on story, puzzles, bilingual text, interface, code, saves, procedural WebGL effects and tests. Background illustrations were generated separately; the 3D layer adds depth to point-and-click scenes.","Custom JavaScript · DOM/CSS · WebGL · Web Audio",[5413,5414,5415,5416],{"_63":5411,"_31":5397,"_23":1755},{"_63":5406,"_31":5407,"_23":1128,"_85":5408},{"_63":5401,"_31":5402,"_1463":1464,"_85":5403},{"_63":5396,"_31":5397,"_85":5398},[1289],"