ay SURGE for Oinja","https://oinja-game.vercel.app/","Desktop WebGL and keyboard. WASD/arrows move, Space dodges, Q releases Sync Burst, and E interacts. Attacks are automatic. English and Chinese; no mobile touch controls.",[5602],{"_63":1990,"_31":928,"_85":-7},[5604,5605,5606,5607],"Start a run and try movement, dodging and automatic attacks.","Read the creator’s contribution disclosure.","Inspect combat, progression and map code under src/surge/.","Change one ability combination and check its effect during a new run.","Olivia used GPT-6 Astra in Codex for combat, ability synergies, procedural environments, interface and debugging. The original Oinja universe, creative direction and playtest feedback came from the creator; development involved repeated sessions and revisions.","Three.js · Rapier 3D · TypeScript",[5604,5605,5606,5607],{"_63":1990,"_31":928,"_23":1442},{"_63":5598,"_31":5599,"_23":1128,"_85":5600},{"_63":5593,"_31":5594,"_1463":1464,"_85":5595},{"_63":5589,"_31":928,"_85":5590},[1289,1462],"example:project-plateau","Project Plateau: Proof Before Dark","A first-person field-photography expedition inspired by The Lost World: frame prehistoric animals, manage four photographic plates, avoid threats and return to camp before daylight fades.","/examples/project-plateau/",{"_25":433,"_27":5617,"_29":5618,"_1160":5674,"_3377":5675,"_1157":145,"_1152":5672,"_1145":5676,"_87":5677,"_80":5678,"_38":5679,"_1424":5680,"_1110":5681,"_133":1454},[5622,5623,5624,5625,5626,5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633,5634,5635,5636,5637,5638,5639,5640,5641,5642],{"_59":27,"_72":5617,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5618,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":5674,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":3375,"_99":100,"_65":5673,"_61":3377,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5672,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":5667,"_61":1145,"_77":-