ng, cover and photographic plates create choices from the novel’s expedition premise.","Read the build brief and verification record to separate a tested route from untested device, sound and optional encounter behavior.","For local play, enter examples/project-plateau/build/app, use Node 22.12+ to install dependencies, then run npm start; the committed runtime assets do not require Blender regeneration.","The creator presents Project Plateau as a NovelToGame adaptation built through analysis, concept, world design, art direction, implementation and QA stages. The public workspace includes game code, committed models and textures, asset-generation scripts and the input trace for one tested path; its coding client is not explicitly identified.",[1115],"Three.js · WebGL2",[1115],[5668,5669,5670,5671],{"_63":5666,"_31":5657,"_23":1755},{"_63":5661,"_31":5662,"_23":1128,"_85":5663},{"_63":5656,"_31":5657,"_85":5658,"_1463":1464},{"_63":5651,"_31":5652,"_85":5653},[1462],"example:isocity-cursor","IsoCity","Build an isometric city with zoning, roads, rail, utilities and a simulated population. IsoCity is a complete Canvas-based browser game that its creator attributes to Cursor.","/examples/isocity-cursor/",{"_25":431,"_27":5683,"_29":5684,"_1160":4845,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":5729,"_1145":5730,"_87":5731,"_80":5732,"_38":5733,"_1424":5734,"_1110":5735},[5688,5689,5690,5691,5692,5693,5694,5695,5696,5697,5698,5699,5700,5701,5702,5703,5704,5705,5706],{"_59":27,"_72":5683,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5684,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":4845,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5729,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":5724,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":5722,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1442,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63