"Open the complete J2ME game and assets","Full Java game, level/resource packs, procedural art/audio tools, tests and packaged full/lite builds. Rebuilding needs JDK8, a MIDP2.0/CLDC1.0 API JAR, ProGuard and the toolchain paths documented in DEVELOPER.md. No repository code license is declared; fonts retain SIL OFL terms.",[5775],{"_63":5776,"_31":5777,"_85":5778},"Download Butch Graves 3D","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D/tree/main/dist","Ready-built v2.3.0 JAR/JAD files: full game1.7MB or lite build994KB without voices. Requires a compatible MIDP2.0 phone or J2ME Loader, KEmulator or FreeJ2ME; it does not launch with ordinary java -jar. Keypad2/8 moves,4/6 turns,1/3 strafes,5 fires,0 uses,7/9 switches weapons,# jumps and* opens the map. Binary downloaded and inspected, but not executed.","Downloadable build",[5781],{"_63":5782,"_31":942,"_85":-7},"Read the creator’s build and testing account",[5784,5785,5786,5787],"Download the full or lite JAR and open it in a compatible J2ME emulator or MIDP 2.0 phone.","Try moving, turning, firing, using doors and switching weapons during the opening episode.","Read the creator’s implementation account and compare src/E.java with the generated resource packs.","Change one level or resource, follow DEVELOPER.md to rebuild, and verify the phone API, memory and audio constraints on the target runtime.","WollyMonjac credits Claude Opus 5.5 with code, levels, art and audio tools. The human supplied the brief and direction, played builds and reported problems; the creator also explains simulator, emulator and real-device testing separately.","Custom fixed-point raycaster · Java MIDP 2.0 / CLDC 1.0",[5784,5785,5786,5787],{"_63":5782,"_31":942,"_23":1755},{"_63":5776,"_31":5777,"_23":1434,"_85":5778},{"_63":5772,"_31":942,"_1463":1464,"_85":5773},{"_63":5767,"_31":5768,"_85":5769},[],"example:pixel-orchard-astra","Pixel Orchard · Memory Harvest","Turn over twelve seed packets to find six matching symbol pairs. Track moves, remember mismatches and reshuffle the garden for another short round.","/examples/pixel-orchard-astra/",{"_25":427,"_27":5797,"_29":5798,"_1160":5845,"_1157":144,"_133":2260,"_1152":5844,"_1145":5846,"_87":5847,"_80":5848,"_38":5849,"_1424":5850,"_1110":5851},[5802,5803,5804,5805,5806,5807,5808,5809,5810,5811,5812,5813,5814,5815,5816,5817,5818,5819],{"_59":27,"_72":5797,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5798,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":5845,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":2259,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5844,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":5839,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":5835,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":2728,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":5831,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":5827,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":5822,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":5821},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":946,"_581":5820,"_583":945,"_38":947,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1491},{"_59":69,"_61":1404,"_63":1405,"_72":94},"/GameMap/media/learning/pixel-orchard-astra.webp",[2296],[5823],{"_63":5824,"_31":5825,"_85":5826},"Read the creator’s generation disclosure","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/README.md","The author describes these as Astra-generated standalone HTML studies; this particular entry includes a complete playable memory-game loop and its exact prompt.",[5828],{"_63":1980,"_31":5829,"_85":5830},"https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/013-pixel-orchard.html","The single HTML file contains the entire game, inline CSS, shuffled deck, matching, move counter and reset logic. It opens offline without assets, packages or a build step. No explicit code license was observed.",[5832],{"_63":5833,"_31":947,"_85":5834},"Play Pixel Orchard","English interface; click, tap or focus card buttons with the keyboard. PLANT AGAIN reshuffles and resets the round. No login, installation or network dependencies after loading.",[5836],{"_63":5837,"_31":5838,"_85":-7},"Read the exact game prompt","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/013-pixel-orchard.txt",[5840,5841,5842,5843],"Flip two cards and watch how matches and mismatches behave.","Compare the exact prompt with the complete inline implementation.","Inspect shuffle, turn locking and reset during a delayed mismatch.","Change the deck and complete a round, then verify reset and keyboard access.","MiaAI-Lab identifies the collection as GPT-6 Astra-generated and preserves this game’s exact prompt. The prompt specifies complete matching, reset and rapid-input behavior; the particular chat or coding client and manual refinement are not disclosed.","DOM/CSS · Vanilla JavaScript",[5840,5841,5842,5843],{"_63":5837,"_31":5838,"_23":2728},{"_63":5833,"_31":947,"_23":1128,"_85":5834},{"_63":1980,"_31":5829,"_1463":1464,"_85":5830},{"_63":5824,"_31":5825,"_85":5826},[],"example:fruit-ninja-dojo-astra","Fruit Ninja Dojo · One More Slice","Swipe through airborne fruit, chain slices and dodge bombs in an unofficial Fruit Ninja recreation with Classic, sixty-second Arcade and ninety-second Zen modes.","/examples/fruit-ninja-dojo-astra/",{"_25":425,"_27":5853,"_29":5854,"_1160":5900,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":5899,"_1145":5901,"_87":5902,"_80":5903,"_38":5904,"_1424":5905,"_1110":5906},[5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,5875],{"_59":27,"_72":5853,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5854,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":5900,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":103,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":5899