_23":1128,"_85":5949},{"_63":1980,"_31":5943,"_1463":1464,"_85":5944},{"_63":5938,"_31":5939,"_85":5940},[],"example:nagi-home-cowork","Nagi Home","Care for Nagi, a small crab living in a procedural home: place food, throw a ball, request furniture activities and follow a diary as daily needs change. It is a quiet life simulation with saved progress.","/examples/nagi-home-cowork/",{"_25":421,"_27":5968,"_29":5969,"_1160":6018,"_1157":145,"_133":1454,"_1152":6017,"_1145":6019,"_87":6020,"_80":6021,"_38":6022,"_1424":6023,"_1110":6024},[5973,5974,5975,5976,5977,5978,5979,5980,5981,5982,5983,5984,5985,5986,5987,5988,5989,5990,5991],{"_59":27,"_72":5968,"_61":27,"_77":-7},{"_59":134,"_72":5969,"_61":29,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1158,"_72":6018,"_61":1160,"_77":128},{"_59":69,"_63":1156,"_72":104,"_61":1157,"_77":96},{"_59":69,"_63":1153,"_72":1452,"_61":133,"_77":1155},{"_59":69,"_63":1150,"_72":6017,"_61":1152,"_77":128},{"_59":97,"_63":1142,"_99":1143,"_65":6012,"_61":1145,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1137,"_65":6009,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1441,"_72":1442,"_61":87,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1135,"_72":1136,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1129,"_65":6005,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":74,"_72":1128,"_61":80,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":122,"_65":6001,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":69,"_63":1428,"_72":1429,"_61":38,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1422,"_65":5997,"_61":1424,"_77":-7},{"_59":60,"_63":1108,"_65":5995,"_61":1110,"_77":-7},{"_59":97,"_61":1411,"_63":1412,"_65":5993},{"_59":1406,"_61":1407,"_63":959,"_581":5992,"_583":958,"_38":960,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_1409":1491},{"_59":69,"_61":1404,"_63":1405,"_72":94},"/GameMap/media/learning/nagi-home-cowork.webp",[5994],"Claude Cowork",[5996],{"_63":1418,"_31":1419},[5998],{"_63":4407,"_31":5999,"_85":6000},"https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home#readme","README credits explicitly name Claude Cowork and Claude Opus 5.5, with human planning/publishing attribution.",[6002],{"_63":1980,"_31":6003,"_85":6004},"https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home","Complete single-file HTML with procedural Three.js scene, need/activity systems, dialogue and localStorage saves; MIT code. Three.js r169 is loaded from jsDelivr and fonts from Google Fonts, so a clean run requires those network resources. No coding-agent subscription is needed to play.",[6006],{"_63":6007,"_31":960,"_85":6008},"Play Nagi Home","Japanese interface. Drag to orbit, wheel/pinch to zoom; the food and ball buttons trigger interactions. Normal food placement and ball throwing were checked in Chrome, including diary feedback. This is a life simulation without a combat or level-completion goal.",[6010],{"_63":6011,"_31":5999,"_85":-7},"Read the creator’s Cowork and simulation notes",[6013,6014,6015,6016],"Place food or throw the ball, then watch Nagi’s activity and diary change.","Read the single index.html to follow daily needs, activity selection, Three.js models and localStorage persistence.","Serve the repository with a static HTTP server or open its HTML in a browser; Three.js and fonts are fetched from external CDNs.","Change one need or activity rule, then check its effect at normal and accelerated time speeds.","The creator explicitly says Claude Opus 5.5 generated the code in Claude Cowork. Human planning and publishing are credited separately. Cowork is retained as the actual client rather than being relabelled Claude Code; the conversation itself is not published.","Three.js r169 · JavaScript",[6013,6014,6015,6016],{"_63":6011,"_31":5999,"_23":1442},{"_63":6007,"_31":960,"_23":1128,"_85":6008},{"_63":1980,"_31":6003,"_1463":1464,"_85":6004},{"_63":4407,"_31":5999,"_85":6000},[1462],"example:clockout-unseen-codex","Clock Out Unseen","Sneak out of three offices before time expires, using furniture, coffee distractions and a temporary folder disguise to avoid patrol sightlines and reach an elevator.","/examples/clockout-unseen-codex/",{"_25":419,"_27":6026,"_29":6027,"_1160":6076,"_1157":144,"_133":1454,"_1152":6075,"_1145"